MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

If you want to use the physical map in place of the genetic map in
calc_genoprob() you can either

   - revise the yaml file so that the physical map file is used as the
genetic map

   - OR, after read_cross2(), paste over the genetic map with the
physical map using

     allpheno$gmap <- allpheno$pmap

karl

